#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Frozen H-036 owner prerequisite gate.

No argument is the canonical gate.  Before product bytes exist it is RED only
for the exact runtime-supervisor absence.  After product publication the same
command runs the subject through the public launcher.  ``--product`` adds an
object-derived direct-child identity proof.  ``--reference-host`` is a
judge-only architecture satisfiability lane and can never credit the subject.
"""

